{"message":"I reviewed the available October records. They confirm the $450.00 interest credit posted on October 31, but they do not include the APY breakdown or identify which components were applied. Therefore, I cannot reliably confirm from the available records whether the Green Checking +0.75% boost, EcoCard +0.60% bonus, or +0.025% relationship bonus was included.

The account and product records show that you were eligible for all three during October, and the Green Checking boost should be the selected checking boost because checking boosts do not stack. However, eligibility alone does not prove that the system applied each component to the October calculation.

I have not issued an interest correction because the actual APY and daily balances for October are not available, so the precise discrepancy cannot be calculated. Would you like me to transfer this to a human agent for an APY-component and interest-calculation review?"}
